# seg game run raises the CPU governor and an AMD GPU's power level while a
# game runs, and puts them back. These two commands, with these arguments and
# nothing else, are all the gamemode group may run as root; the program checks
# the process id and the governor, and touches only the cpufreq and amdgpu
# power files.
%gamemode ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/seg game boost on [0-9]*, /usr/bin/seg game boost off [0-9]*
